NEW FINDINGS
G1 Minor. "✓ proved symbolically" for identities whose sides differ at one point, with no "for x ≠ 0" note:
   sign(x) =? x/|x| (right side undefined at 0), d/dx |x| =? sign(x) (no derivative at 0, sign(0) = 0),
