   form still give noise instead of the "refused" the fix claims. asymptotic::far_tail is used only when the last range
   is [c, +∞) with c >= 1e8 (definite.rs numeric_bounds).
     ∫_{-∞}^{-10^17} sin x/x² dx       ≈ 6.599828355e-32    true 8.855573283e-35
     ∫_{-∞}^{-10^17} cos x/x² dx       ≈ 0                  true 4.645301048e-35
