  these finite ranges says "could not determine whether ... converges", which is odd wording for a finite range.
  Suggest: the Gaussian-times-cosine closed form, splitting a symmetric far range at 0, and treating a bounded
  oscillating term that is small next to the main term as non-oscillating.

Note: final\mpp.exe and final2 differ only where listed above. No panics. Every probe file ran in under 3 s.
