    not ℒ{f}. Braces become ( ). The parser turns \mathcal{L}_{t\to s}\{…\} into the operator "laplace"
    (mpp-syntax math/parser/atoms.rs:209) and the renderer prints the operator name. The same text is in the HTML
    export snapshots (mpp-export/tests/snapshots/auto-evaluation.html, aria-label "invfourier(…)").
    Shots: r4\t-021-laplace.png, t-022-laplace_inv.png, t-023-fourier.png, t-024-fourier_inv.png (sheet r4\sheets\tmpl-01.png).
