    Open examples/proofs.mpp and hover the ✗ step of Theorem 3. The card reads
    "wrong: $(x + 1)^2 = x^2 + 1$ fails …". The ✗ glyph is also missing and the card says "wrong — wrong:".
    A second assumptions message says "(Assume $…$.)". Problem.rich holds the same raw string, so the Problems panel
    has the same text.
